白噪音的声音大小也刚刚好。

6
00:00:11,182 --> 00:00:14,021
It also doubles as a night light and you can even set a timer.
还能当小夜灯用，甚至可以设定时。

7
00:00:14,022 --> 00:00:16,461
And with the stand, you can always find the perfect angle.
有了这个支架，总能找到舒服的送风角度。

8
00:00:16,462 --> 00:00:17,621
Got a summer trip coming up?
夏天准备出门旅行吗？

9
00:00:17,622 --> 00:00:18,741
Just throw it in your bag.
把它放进包里就行。

10
00:00:18,742 --> 00:00:19,941
I linked it down below for you.
链接我放在下面，

11
00:00:19,942 --> 00:00:22,651
And don't forget to check for any extra coupons before you check out.
结账前也别忘了看看还有没有额外优惠券。
